msgid "Development"
msgstr "开发指南"

msgid "This page is for developers who want to contribute to ResourcePackServer or build their own tooling around it."
msgstr "此页面面向希望为 ResourcePackServer 贡献代码或基于它构建工具链的开发者。"

msgid "Project Structure"
msgstr "项目结构"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

msgid "**Dual-Mode Design**"
msgstr "**双模式设计**"

msgid "ResourcePackServer follows the same pattern as `PrimeBackup <https://github.com/TISUnion/PrimeBackup>`__:"
msgstr "ResourcePackServer 遵循与 `PrimeBackup <https://github.com/TISUnion/PrimeBackup>`__ 相同的模式："

msgid "**Environment detection**: ``ServerInterface.psi_opt()`` returns ``None`` → standalone mode"
msgstr "**环境检测**：``ServerInterface.psi_opt()`` 返回 ``None`` → 独立模式"

msgid "**Shared core**: ``server.py``, ``pack_merger.py``, ``config.py`` are mode-agnostic"
msgstr "**共享核心**：``server.py``、``pack_merger.py``、``config.py`` 与模式无关"

msgid "**Dual entrypoints**: ``cli/cli_entrypoint.py`` for CLI, ``mcdr/mcdr_entrypoint.py`` for MCDR"
msgstr "**双入口**：``cli/cli_entrypoint.py`` 用于 CLI，``mcdr/mcdr_entrypoint.py`` 用于 MCDR"

msgid "**Logger**: Detects MCDR environment and uses ``psi.logger`` or creates its own"
msgstr "**日志器**：检测 MCDR 环境，使用 ``psi.logger`` 或自行创建"

msgid "**Pack Merging**"
msgstr "**资源包合并**"

msgid "``pack_merger.py`` implements deterministic multi-pack merging:"
msgstr "``pack_merger.py`` 实现了确定性的多包合并："

msgid "Packs are read into memory as ``{filename: bytes}`` dicts"
msgstr "资源包以 ``{filename: bytes}`` 字典形式读入内存"

msgid "Merged from lowest to highest priority → higher priority overwrites"
msgstr "从低优先级到高优先级合并 → 高优先级覆盖"

msgid "``pack.mcmeta`` is special-cased: highest-priority metadata is the base; ``description`` fields from all packs are concatenated"
msgstr "``pack.mcmeta`` 有特殊处理：最高优先级的元数据为基础；所有包的 ``description`` 字段被拼接"

msgid "``pack.png`` is taken from the first pack that has one (highest priority)"
msgstr "``pack.png`` 取自第一个拥有此文件的包（最高优先级）"

msgid "Result is cached; cache is invalidated when any source pack's ``mtime`` changes"
msgstr "结果被缓存；当任何源包的 ``mtime`` 更改时缓存失效"

msgid "Building Docs"
msgstr "构建文档"

msgid "Running Tests"
msgstr "运行测试"
